WEBVTT

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.390
<i>Episode 16</i>

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:50.110
Where is Chief Taoist Meihai?

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:53.040
Please be patient, Beauty Chu.

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:56.280
Master is practicing his disco moves.
He will be here shortly.

00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:59.140
What kind of place does 
he think my Ye Palace is?

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:01.920
Enough with your nonsense. If he is not
here soon, it is the dungeon for you!

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:05.370
Please do not be angry, madam.
I will summon him right away.

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:06.630
I am here.

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:10.560
Ah, master, you are here!

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.810
I apologize for my tardiness. 
Please forgive me, madam.

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:20.810
Open up! Open up! Stop skulking around in there!

00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:25.360
These people...

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:28.550
Greetings—

00:02:28.550 --> 00:02:29.750
Grab this maid.

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:30.480
Yes, mistress.

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:40.970
Beauty Chu, d-did I do something wrong?

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:42.850
Ask your mistress.

00:02:44.770 --> 00:02:47.470
Mochi, stop pushing me!

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:50.230
No way.

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:02.000
Your Highness.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.930
I have sent you back to the prince.

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:05.280
Try running away now.

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:08.620
Man, I need sleep.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:18.680
The prince isn't here?

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:23.450
I do not know. All I know is His Highness went
 to the Imperial Palace early this morning.

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:30.060
I'm going back to the 
Serenity Pavilion then, Aunt Su.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.680
The implements have been prepared. 
Please go ahead, Chief Taoist.

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:46.960
You likely do not know...

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:49.060
There is immense evil energy here.

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:56.540
Chief Taoist, please help us exorcise
 and uproot these evil spirits.

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:03.550
I can create a barrier here
to exorcise the spirits.

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:06.960
Once the spirit enters, 
it will not be able to escape.

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:08.840
Its energy will disperse and it will perish.

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:09.730
What?!

00:04:10.820 --> 00:04:12.900
Chief Taoist, there are no evil spirits here!

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:14.180
You must have made a mistake!

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:15.880
Ridiculous!

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:19.180
Master is renowned throughout the capital.
How could he make a mistake?

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:22.750
Beauty Chu, please have mercy on us!

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:24.430
There truly are no evil spirits here!

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:27.430
The Chief Taoist will determine 
if there are evil spirits here.

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:29.430
How dare you make a fuss!

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:32.810
Qiuzhu, slap her with all your might.

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:34.460
Yes, mistress.

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:52.630
Still feeling smug?

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:54.540
How dare you bully Que'er!

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:13.700
What <i>is</i> that?!

00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:18.350
Ch-Chief Taoist, help us.

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:20.850
Experience thousands of 
calamities and prove my power!

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:25.570
Disperse!

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:34.390
Where did you spring from,
you infernal monk? Get out of here!

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.480
You are only a little demon.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:39.770
Leave now, or you will perish here.

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:44.110
I will show you the power of a little demon!

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:14.560
I will leave this to you. I will 
continue preparing the barrier.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:22.750
<i>I've brought them some delicious 
snacks. They'll be happy for sure!</i>

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.250
Aunt Su, do you have to keep following me?

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:30.060
His Highness asked me to serve 
Your Highness at all times.

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:52.560
Officer Ghost is here!
Don't even think about escaping!

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:02.990
Damn! I will go all-out against you.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:36.880
What are you doing in my Serenity Pavilion?

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:41.060
Oh, our sister has returned.

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:43.180
Why is it always you?

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:47.840
Sister, do you not realize there are 
evil spirits in the Serenity Pavilion?

00:07:48.270 --> 00:07:51.060
I personally invited the
Chief Taoist to exorcise them.

00:07:51.310 --> 00:07:54.550
Where are these evil spirits? 
I think you're the evil spirit here.

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:56.960
If you want to get rid of 
evil spirits, exorcise yourself.

00:07:56.960 --> 00:07:58.870
Get everyone out of my place right now!

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:00.510
You... You...

00:08:10.770 --> 00:08:11.470
Sesame?

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:14.220
Mistress Yunxi...

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:17.470
Que'er?

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:18.690
Stand up!

00:08:18.690 --> 00:08:19.470
My lady...

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:29.880
Did you do all this?

00:08:34.850 --> 00:08:36.550
You are most welcome, sister.

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:40.200
It is my duty to take care of the 
palace and manage the servants...

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:46.850
Oh my…

00:08:48.150 --> 00:08:49.100
This girl?

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:53.600
How dare you hit me!

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:58.110
I <i>do</i> dare, and I'm gonna hit you 
ten-thousand and eighty-six times.

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:00.990
You wench! What right do you have to hit me?

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:07.180
Because I am the princess, 
and you are a concubine!

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:29.040
No!

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:31.860
The Chief Taoist's spell is complete.

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:44.190
Break!

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:55.330
I can't move?

00:10:36.390 --> 00:10:40.350
Good, good. You have some ability.

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:48.840
Your Highness, Beauty Chu invited
the Chief Taoist to the Serenity Pavilion,

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:50.940
and I do not know what they are planning.

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:52.430
I worry about Her Highness.

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:57.800
Stupid Taoist.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.850
Your barrier's toast.

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:01.280
Get out of here!

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:06.230
With a talent such as yours, 
I would take you as my apprentice.

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:10.100
There is only one person I call Master,
so get that thought out of your head.

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:20.550
L-Let me go!

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:24.510
Today, you will come with me
 even if you do not want to.

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:32.410
Who are you? Answer me!

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:37.090
It is a misunderstanding.

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:41.790
I invited Chief Taoist Meihai to exorcise
the evil spirits and keep the palace safe.

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:45.310
What happened between you and him?
Why was he taking you away?

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:47.400
He wants me to be his apprentice.

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:51.580
Hey, that hurts. What are you doing?

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:55.720
If any man other than me comes near you...

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:57.470
he must die!

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:11.540
Enough. This ends now.

00:12:12.270 --> 00:12:12.850
We go.

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:15.000
Yes, master.

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:30.420
Que'er, your face...

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:32.390
I am all right.

00:12:33.820 --> 00:12:35.840
The Serenity Pavilion 
has always been haunted.

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:39.090
I simply wanted to exorcise all 
the evil spirits from the palace.

00:12:39.090 --> 00:12:40.100
Please forgive—

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:46.000
Out. All of you.

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:48.600
If anyone takes one step 
toward the Serenity Pavilion...

00:12:49.070 --> 00:12:50.480
I will kill them myself!

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:53.520
I-I am leaving now...

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:55.970
Hurry, hurry!

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:03.960
What do we do now, my lady?

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:08.560
I'll go to Grandpa Ginkgo 
and ask him to heal you.

00:13:09.270 --> 00:13:12.720
<i>That Mochi... He always goes 
missing at the critical moment!</i>

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:22.060
My lady! I am healed!

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:27.400
They will be fine. Sesame still
needs some time to recover.

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:29.380
Thank you, Grandpa!

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:31.610
You are most welcome, most welcome.

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:37.220
Where did <i>you</i> go?! Sesame almost 
got killed by that stinky Taoist!

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:40.430
Why are you going bananas?
I just took a little nap, that's all!

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:45.050
That's what happens.

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:47.380
What are you doing? Put me down!

00:13:48.190 --> 00:13:50.580
I said, put me down!

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:54.880
I need to talk to you.

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:57.850
If you do not wish me to 
spank you, then be quiet.

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:05.810
You... You... Whoa!

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:08.810
What are you doing?

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:15.740
If I had arrived any later, 
that Taoist would have taken you away.

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:20.220
Y-You've gotta be kidding. As if I'd 
let some stinky Taoist take me away...

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:23.090
<i><i>Is he worried about me?</i></i>

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:29.810
Listen, I will protect you.

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:34.330
I promise you...

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:37.630
I will never let something 
like this happen ever again.

00:14:39.860 --> 00:14:41.020
You are my princess,

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:43.470
and only I may bask in your beauty.

00:14:43.470 --> 00:14:46.420
Aside from me, men are off-limits to you.

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:44.960
Your Highness!

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:47.590
Your Highness!

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:49.780
Que'er is here. Get up!

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:52.910
I do not care. It does not 
matter if she sees us.

00:14:53.770 --> 00:14:55.310
Get up!

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:02.970
His Highness has decided to rest. Let's go.

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:04.830
Come on, come on.

00:15:05.470 --> 00:15:07.000
Where do I put this stuff?

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:08.230
Over here. Here.

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:09.860
Slow down and give it to me.

00:15:10.980 --> 00:15:13.800
Mochi, why are you messing 
around so early in the morning?

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:18.400
Qian Yunxi, why are you yelling 
so early in the morning?

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:23.720
Come on, hurry up.

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:27.440
Your Highness, there are sixteen
swings left in the storeroom.

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.420
Bring them all and install 
them for my princess.

00:15:31.730 --> 00:15:35.720
But, Your Highness, there are not 
enough trees in the Serenity Pavilion...

00:15:36.150 --> 00:15:37.720
Then, plant more.

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:40.720
Pardon? But...

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:40.720
Oh, I know.

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:44.960
Dig up the tall trees in the 
back garden and move them here.

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:46.240
Yes, Highness.

00:15:48.650 --> 00:15:49.720
Stop them already.

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:54.220
Look, my lady!

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:02.430
What's all this about?

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.720
From today, I shall be living here.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:10.220
The prince is coming to live here? Great!

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:15.470
Indeed. It seems so nice here.

00:16:15.880 --> 00:16:18.720
I will reside in the Serenity 
Pavilion with my dear wife.

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:30.850
How did your mission go?

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:35.220
My lord, I have discovered 
the whereabouts of the ring.

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:38.110
Excellent work.
